 "description": "Verify data integrity: pass a dataHash from any ChainRay response's _proof field to verify that the data was produced by ChainRay. Use after receiving a ChainRay response with _proof.dataHash to verify its integrity. It verifies a supplied hash and does not independently validate the underlying blockchain data.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
